Description:
Lightweight binding to DirectWrite.

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/dwrote-rs/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/dwrote-rs/ unchanged.

